  "transcription": "Combiflam. Anti-inflammatory Analgesic. Each uncoated tablet contains: Ibuprofen I.P. - 400mg. Paracetamol I.P. - 325mg. Excipients q.s. Store below 30C away from moisture. Dosage: Adult: 1 tablet 3 times a day or as directed by the Physician. SCHEDULE H DRUG: WARNING To be sold by retail on the prescription of a Registered Medical Practitioner only. Warning: Taking more than daily dose may cause serious liver damage or allergic reactions. Caution: Bronchospasm may be precipitated in patients suffering from asthma. Manufactured By: SANOFI INDIA LIMITED. Plot No. 3501, 3503-15, G.I.D.C. Estate, Ankleshwar-393 002. Mfg. Lic. No.: G/811.",
